{"id":"vod_sn_38286","vodId":"38286","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"学生会的一己之见第二季","name_cn":"学生会的一己之见第二季","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/02a5d4300fc723ed13d5b84c534fd70d.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在私立碧阳学园之中，这里的学生会成员，是凭借着学生们在学校的人气而选出的，这也就意味着，能够进入学生会的，都是在校园中超级受欢迎的美少女！杉崎键（近藤隆 配音）凭借着自己的努力和毅力最终当选了学生会副会长的职位，亦成为了学生会中唯一的一名男生，而他拼尽全力也要杀入学生会的理由，就是想让学生会的所有女生们都成为他的后宫。　　娇小可爱的樱野栗梦（本多真梨子 配音）、成熟稳重的红叶知弦（美名 配音）、活力满满擅长运动的椎名深夏（富樫美铃 配音）、温文尔雅娇弱可怜的椎名真冬（野水伊织 配音），在这些女孩子们中间，杉崎键的日常会是怎样的面貌呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:59:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ea3G8Y8z151/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L1ywT9hcKR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xQHPWCMYdv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cg1g19Fj9k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RpKDgMWTmN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cK1jNG8KBF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WY9nqsgvEk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u1am5euKVy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KRSwPG5zLU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EguE7qamUW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5TkXqBmaxE1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:00.894Z"}